  "result": "JWT `exp` field = Unix seconds. `Date.now()` = milliseconds.\n\n**Bug:** comparison always false \u2014 `exp` (e.g. `1713600000`) tiny vs `Date.now()` (e.g. `1713600000000`). Expired tokens pass.\n\n**Fix:**\n\n```js\n// Wrong\nif (Date.now() > payload.exp) { ... }\n\n// Correct\nif (Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) > payload.exp) { ... }\n// or\nif (Date.now() > payload.exp * 1000) { ... }\n```\n\nAdd clock skew buffer (optional but recommended):\n\n```js\nconst CLOCK_SKEW = 30; // seconds\nif (Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) > payload.exp + CLOCK_SKEW) {\n  throw new Error('Token expired');\n}\n```",
